{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "6abbbc91adb050288c6240dd"
  },
  "title": "A Good-Looking Website Is Not Always a Working Website",
  "slug": "good-looking-website-not-working",
  "excerpt": "A website can look professional and still fail to generate enquiries. Learn why clear content, proper structure, and SEO matter more than design alone.",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A Good-Looking Website Is Not Always a Working Website"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One thing we often notice while working with business websites is this:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "The website looks good, but the business is still not getting enquiries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The problem is usually not the design."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A customer may search for a service on Google, but if Google cannot clearly understand "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "what you offer, where you provide it, and which page should appear for that search"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", your website may never reach that customer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For example, a business may offer five different services but explain all of them in a few lines on the homepage. To the business owner, everything looks clear. To a search engine — and sometimes even to the customer — it may not be."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This is where SEO actually starts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Not with repeating keywords everywhere, but with making every important page answer three simple questions:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "What is this page about?"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Who is it useful for?"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "What should the visitor do next?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A website should not only look professional."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "It should help the right customer "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "find you, understand you, and contact you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "That small difference is what turns a website from an online brochure into a business tool."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "7. Featured Image"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a clean image showing a business website on a laptop or desktop screen, preferably with a simple search/analytics concept rather than heavy SEO graphics."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Alt Text"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Business website optimized for better visibility and customer enquiries"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "8. SEO Title"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Good-Looking Website But No Enquiries? Here’s Why"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "9. Visibility"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Public"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "10. Meta Description"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your website may look professional but still fail to generate enquiries. Learn how SEO, clear content, and website structure help customers find your business."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "11. Canonical URL"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://merasoftware.com/blog/good-looking-website-not-working",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "rel": "noopener",
                  "class": null,
                  "title": null
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "https://merasoftware.com/blog/good-looking-website-not-working"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "12. Comments Setting"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Comments Off"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "13. Schedule / Publish"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Publish Now"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
